---

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Employee
  participant API as CurrentRoleFlowController
  participant Flow as RoleBaselineFlow
  participant Catalog as CurrentRoleCatalog
  participant Store as CurrentRoleSelectionStore
  participant PG as PostgreSQL learner state
  Employee->>API: Choose Role and actual member Level with retry key
  API->>Flow: Trusted workspace actor and expected selection
  Flow->>Catalog: Resolve available organization Role and Level
  Flow->>Store: Write requested target pair
  Store->>PG: Learner lock, authorized replay and revision checks
  alt Same Role and Level
    Store-->>Employee: Reauthorized no-op
  else Changed pair
    Store->>PG: Check targetBound and active assessment BEFORE archive
    Store->>PG: Archive prior pointer, retain history and persist selection
    Store-->>Employee: Selection revision and receipt
  end
  Employee->>Flow: Read next step
  Flow->>PG: Compatible official evidence and selected-target diagnostics
  Flow-->>Employee: Baseline exemptions, resume, required or unavailable
  Note over Employee,Catalog: Department filtering exists in UI, uniform server enforcement unverified
